<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan Sugar to tender 30,000 tonnes US corn/soy.</title>
<headline>Taiwan Sugar to tender 30,000 tonnes US corn/soy.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>State-owned Taiwan Sugar Corp will tender on Tuesday for a combined shipment of 20,000 tonnes U.S. corn and 10,000 U.S. soybean, local traders said on Friday.</p>
<p>Details for the tender are as follow:</p>
<p>			 U.S. Gulf	  Pacific N.W.</p>
<p> Corn     20,000   Feb 25-March 10  March 10-March 25</p>
<p> Soybean  10,000   Feb 25-March 10  March 10-March 25</p>
<p>--Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
</text>
